--   Error of M̃_C
-- statement:
--   **Error of `M̃_C`.** If `M̃r` is within `Er·hp` of the bilinear contraction `Mr` on grid inputs of norm `≤ 1`, then for `‖f‖ ≤ 1`, `‖g‖ ≤ 7/10` and `Er·hp ≤ 3/10`, `‖M̃_C(f,g) - θ⁻·Mr(θ f, θ g)‖ ≤ (Er + 12)hp` and `‖M̃_C(f,g)‖ ≤ 7/10 + Er·hp`.
--
